---
layout: layout.njk
title: Lion Dance
permalink: /lion-dance/
description: Book our lion dance troupe for Chinese New Year, grand openings, weddings, and corporate events in Vancouver.
---

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Lion Dance</span>
    <h1>Bring Luck &amp; Tradition to Your Event</h1>
    <p class="muted" style="max-width:60ch;">Our lion dance troupe performs for Chinese New Year, grand openings, weddings, and corporate events across Metro Vancouver.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="two-column two-column--image-right">
      <img src="{{ '/images/slhk-association-full-3000px.png' | url }}" alt="Lion dance troupe performing" loading="lazy">
      <div>
        <h2>What We Offer</h2>
        <div class="prose">
          <p>Every troupe member trains in kung fu first — lion dance is a performance art built on real martial skill, not just costume work. That shows in the precision and stamina of every performance.</p>
          <p>We perform the Southern (Cantonese) lion style, with live drum, gong, and cymbal accompaniment.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 style="text-align:center;">Performance Types</h2>
    <div class="grid grid--3">
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Chinese New Year</h3>
        <p class="muted">Traditional blessing performances for homes and businesses.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Grand Openings</h3>
        <p class="muted">Bring good fortune to a new business location.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <h3>Weddings &amp; Corporate Events</h3>
        <p class="muted">Custom performances for private celebrations.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 style="text-align:center;">Past Events</h2>
    <div class="grid grid--3">
      {% for i in range(0, 3) %}
      <div class="card">
        <img src="{{ '/images/shaolin-hung-kuen-2000px.png' | url }}" alt="Lion dance performance photo" loading="lazy" style="border-radius: var(--radius); margin-bottom: 12px;">
        <p class="muted">Performance photos are added by our editors as events happen.</p>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cta-band cta-band--red">
      <h2>Ready to Book?</h2>
      <p>Tell us about your event and we'll follow up with availability and pricing.</p>
      <a class="btn btn--gold" href="{{ '/book-lion-dance/' | url }}">Request a Booking</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
